# Generated notebook outputs and Quarto/Jupyter intermediates.
# The .qmd files are the source of truth; rebuild with `quarto render notebooks`.
# Rendered .ipynb files ARE tracked (one per source .qmd) so they preview on GitHub;
# only the HTML, Quarto intermediates, and supporting _files/ dirs stay ignored.
/.quarto/
.jupyter_cache/
**/*.quarto_ipynb
*.html
*_files/
